Package: mgcvUI
Title: Interactive GAM Builder for Real Estate Appraisers
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("William", "Craytor", email = "bcraytor@proton.me",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A 'shiny' application for building, diagnosing, and reporting
    Generalized Additive Models (GAMs) via 'mgcv'. Designed for real estate
    appraisers who need transparent, defensible nonlinear models. Optionally
    imports knot structure from 'earth' MARS models (e.g. via 'earthUI') to
    bridge exploratory and confirmatory modelling stages. The generalized
    additive model methods are described in Wood (2011)
    <doi:10.1111/j.1467-9868.2010.00749.x>.
